 "intro_zh": "花果山以古典名著《西游记》所描述的“孙大圣老家”而著称于世，因美猴王的神话故事而家喻户晓，名闻海内外。花果山自然景观呈现山海相依、崎峭与开阔呼应对比的壮丽景色。山里古树参天、水流潺潺、花果飘香、猕猴嬉闹、奇峰异洞、怪石云海、景色秀丽。主要景点有阿育王塔、水帘洞、三元宫等。",
 "intro_en": "Huaguo Mountain is world-famous as the \"Hometown of Sun Dasheng\" described in the classic \"Journey to the West\". It is also well-known at home and abroad for the myth of the Monkey King. The natural landscape of Huaguo Mountain presents a magnificent scenery of mountains and seas, ruggedness and openness. In the mountains, there are towering ancient trees, gurgling water, fragrant flowers and fruits, frolicking macaques, strange peaks and caves, strange rocks and sea of ​​clouds, and beautiful scenery. The main attractions include Ashoka Tower, Water Curtain Cave, Sanyuan Palace, etc.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
